        "original_id": "1dae197c-a56b-52f6-a931-a78ce32b4714",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: R. D. Reid, Zack Snyder, George A. Romero, James Gunn, Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, Mekhi Phifer, Kevin Zegers, Deborah Snyder, Wesley Coller\n- Companies: Cruel and Unusual Films\n- Products: Dawn of the Dead (2004 film), Diary of the Dead, Dawn of the Dead (1978 film), Transamerica, It's a Boy Girl Thing, The Jane Austen Book Club, Fifty Dead Men Walking, Frozen\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Dawn of the Dead was released as a remake of George A. Romero's 1978 film of the same name.\n- In 2004, Dawn of the Dead was written by James Gunn and starred Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, and Mekhi Phifer.\n- In 2004, Zack Snyder, Deborah Snyder, and Wesley Coller established the American film production company Cruel and Unusual Films, Inc.\n- R. D. Reid appeared in Zack Snyder's Dawn of the Dead and in George A. Romero's Diary of the Dead.\n- Kevin Zegers starred in Dawn of the Dead in 2004, Transamerica in 2005, It's a Boy Girl Thing in 2006, The Jane Austen Book Club in 2007, Fifty Dead Men Walking in 2008, and Frozen in 2010.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
